i+\\left((-2)(-2)^{2}\\right)\\,j=6\\,i-8\\,j \\\\ F(2,- \\frac{3}{2}) & =\\left((2)(2)(- \\frac{3}{2})\\right)\\,i+\\left((-2)(2)^{2}\\right)\\,j=-6\\,i-8\\,j\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe now draw our vectors. At each point, we draw the vector associated with that point, placing the tail end of the vector on the point itself. This gives the following diagram.\n\n![](images/e8/e829b1ebe911b3c3ae1a6e871d10a36931fef7f950933abda5ea226fd4c9ae66.png)" 13194139535579 17592186045443 true] [17592186518772 1080 "images/88/88d6157b6d961bfcfe66f9d0635c7c75e754fa33d182971f3e8722821995a7bf.png" 13194139535579 17592186045443 true] [17592186518772 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045497 13194139535579 17592186045443 true] [17592186518772 1083 #uuid "1cd0dcd1-823c-5bfe-a3b4-87f697bc1cc5" 13194139535579 17592186045443 true] [17592186518773 1080 "images/34/34fe0d8361633cbf6a7242584878f75edce90dbf4a353e74c4f3ecb5ff3540b3.png" 13194139535579 17592186045443 true] [17592186518773 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045497 13194139535579 17592186045443 true] [17592186518773 1083 #uuid "20376de9-73cc-5220-b1b5-d05e47b251ad" 13194139535579 17592186045443 true] [17592186518774 1080 "images/0d/0d2feddba8eb9c880f7a0dfd88b2b1f936f8bfa1de33f205c408fd776a33a579.png" 13194139535579 17592186045443 true] [17592186518774 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045497 13194139535579 17592186045443 true] [17592186518774 1083 #uuid "2325b410-0c6c-5f57-bcd5-530841a89169" 13194139535579 17592186045443 true] [17592186518775 1068 #edb/ref 17592186518797 13194139535579 17592186045443 true] [17592186518775 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 13194139535579 17592186045443 true] [17592186518775 1071 "Which of the following diagrams represents the vector field $F(x,y)=-x y\\,i-2 x^{2}\\,j$ at the indicated points?" 13194139535579 17592186045443 true] [17592186518775 1072 #uuid "25249ebb-67f9-5eb6-a85d-bb04853f2c73" 13194139535579 17592186045443 true] [17592186518775 1074 "We have to sketch the vector field at the points $(-2,- \\frac{5}{4}),(1,- \\frac{3}{4}),$ and 